summary.label:
Come to "Idle Bar Tycoon" and build your own bar kingdom!
Here, you can attract customers through publicity;
Various entertainment places can also be built to serve customers;
You can also upgrade various entertainment facilities to earn a lot of money!
Game features:
1. The playing method is super simple, and players can play offline;
2. Diversified operation and management, and the income data are clear at a glance;
3. Carefully built multiple bars for players to switch at will.
